content = " Good day, everyone! 😄 
 
 Thanks to the recent efforts by our team here at Aravoy Customer Service, the customer satisfaction has risen by 9%. This is cause for celebration and as such, the company offers an 25% loan at a 10% monthly interest rate for a company-mandated hangout! 🎊 
 
 The company hangout will be hosted at Terry's place at 4th Concrete Avenue Street. See you all there! 👍"
